    "text": "Meanwhile, Wren attempts to communicate with Ash.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["attempt:communicate"]
  },
  {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "text": "\"Past the bridge, second left.\" Ash tells Wren.",
    "cited_fact_keys": ["reaction:e2de4482-07e9-564a-ac21-8cc6071db631"],
    "speaker_id": "a93bed22-8fed-41f3-82bc-19b393946f9d"
